{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Well, have I been turned into a horse???&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you have, Leappa. Get used to it, grab carrots, and be ready to turn into more animals that move differently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unfamiliar Leaper Movements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you don't just move up, down, left and right! Instead, you move as &quot;leapers&quot;. They move in a specific angle about an axis, a fixed distance each time, and cannot be blocked. Think about the knight in chess, which is a classic leaper! Getting use to the move patterns is the key to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/extras/moving.gif?t=1744141489\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun Traps and Items</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the map of each level, all kinds of traps and items are waiting for you. We got spikes, portals, crates, springs and many more! They interact with each other in unique ways. Understand and use them to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/extras/galloping.gif?t=1744141489\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want some different experience? Behold, boss fights! In boss levels, you don't have to carefully come up with a solution to a puzzle. What you have to do is dodge the boss's rapid attacks, and grab carrots to strike back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/extras/bossing.gif?t=1744141489\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be Casual</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find some levels too hard? Just skip them! Every level is optional. You can advance to any level without completing previous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now go get the carrots, Leappa! Most importantly, you gotta turn back into a rabbit!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529380?t=1744141489","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3529380?t=1744141489","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/61657e6f018f59463967a721d9bf2aae11142773/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744141489","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/61657e6f018f59463967a721d9bf2aae11142773/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744141489","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3566770,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>&quot;Well, have I been turned into a horse???&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, you have, Leappa. Get used to it, grab carrots, and be ready to turn into more animals that move differently!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unfamiliar Leaper Movements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you don't just move up, down, left and right! Instead, you move as &quot;leapers&quot;. They move in a specific angle about an axis, a fixed distance each time, and cannot be blocked. Think about the knight in chess, which is a classic leaper! Getting use to the move patterns is the key to victory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/extras/moving.gif?t=1744141489\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fun Traps and Items</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">On the map of each level, all kinds of traps and items are waiting for you. We got spikes, portals, crates, springs and many more! They interact with each other in unique ways. Understand and use them to your advantage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/extras/galloping.gif?t=1744141489\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Intense Boss Fights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want some different experience? Behold, boss fights! In boss levels, you don't have to carefully come up with a solution to a puzzle. What you have to do is dodge the boss's rapid attacks, and grab carrots to strike back!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/extras/bossing.gif?t=1744141489\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Be Casual</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find some levels too hard? Just skip them! Every level is optional. You can advance to any level without completing previous levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Now go get the carrots, Leappa! Most importantly, you gotta turn back into a rabbit!</p>","developers":["l\u00ec t\u0155","Eastern","Arian"],"dlc":[3546800],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3529380/header.jpg?t=1744141489","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257115266,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257115266/movie480.mp4?t=1742197598","max":"http://video.akama